WEBVTT

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:06.710
"All Sawajiri-Bound Traffic Blocked"

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:20.200
"A Landslide Was the Cause?!"

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.970
"A Landslide Was the Cause?!"
The number of casualties and
missing persons due to this collapse

00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:25.000
- That was a landslide?
- is still under investigation,
and we have no details.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.140
Scary.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:27.800
It was a UFO.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.510
Was it really a natural disaster?

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:35.310
If it were, we wouldn't have to
stay here to be questioned, right?

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:37.650
It was a UFO crash!

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.880
Hey, stop turning this into a joke!

00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:43.190
But you gotta admit this is weird!

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:48.020
If there was really no crime,
then how come we can't leave?!

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:52.360
There has to be something there
that we're not supposed to see!

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:53.830
Oh, please...

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:56.820
He's been watching too much bad TV.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:59.200
Senkawa?

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.190
Oh, I'm just going to take a little walk.

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:09.350
Birdy, what was that?

00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:11.350
I don't know yet.

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:14.720
It was definitely no landslide.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:17.750
But why did you go outside that night?

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:19.750
I felt a strange wave.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:25.400
A strange wave?

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:28.460
Well, I guess it was what you
Earthlings call a "gut feeling."

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:29.450
Huh.

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:43.380
This is awful...

00:01:43.380 --> 00:01:45.210
I said no!

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:47.780
Please? Just for a minute!

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.590
Pretty please?

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:52.090
Sheesh... How did you even get here?

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:54.720
I'm impressed you got past the police cordon.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:00.500
But you can't go any further.
The village is completely sealed off.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:03.500
Please? Just for a minute...

00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:04.630
No way.

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:08.340
If you keep pushing it,
we'll arrest you for obstruction.

00:02:08.340 --> 00:02:10.510
Aw, don't be like that...

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:14.240
Go on, get in the car.
I'll give you a lift back to the cordon.

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:15.230
Dammit!

00:02:20.680 --> 00:02:22.150
Hey!

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:23.850
Tsutomu!

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:25.840
Hey! What the heck?!

00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:31.360
- Let me go!
- I'm so glad you're alive!

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:34.600
I was so worried when I saw
the TV news, I just had to come!

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.190
What's wrong with you?!

00:02:37.270 --> 00:02:44.270
<i>Will the sky one day grow tired of</i>
<i>looking down and lose its blue color?</i>

00:02:44.270 --> 00:02:53.270
<i>There's just one blue sky over this</i>
<i>world rife with countless emotions</i>

00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:00.320
<i>The sound of the battle raging somewhere</i>

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:03.290
<i>And the laughter right nearby</i>

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:06.230
<i>You can never hear it all</i>

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:08.800
<i>Because you have only one story</i>

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:14.700
<i>Only this sky sees all at</i>
<i>once the sorrow and smiles</i>

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:20.680
<i>That simultaneously fall in different</i>
<i>places around this wide world</i>

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:27.180
<i>Will the sky one day grow tired of</i>
<i>looking down and lose its blue color?</i>

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:33.060
<i>How can it stay unchanging after</i>
<i>watching innumerable dramas?</i>

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:39.330
<i>Even now everyone heads to his</i>
<i>own story without knowing a thing</i>

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:47.530
<i>There's just one blue sky over this</i>
<i>world rife with countless emotions</i>

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:58.700
<i>Wordlessly marking out</i>
<i>time longer than anyone's...</i>

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:21.700
Man, you saved me. I owe you one.

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:23.100
Yakiniku.

00:04:24.440 --> 00:04:26.910
You're going to buy me dinner, got it?!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:28.980
Settle for a beef bowl.

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:35.720
I could start shouting "This man
has nothing to do with me," you know.

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:38.320
Okay, okay. I'll do it.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:42.730
Anyway, Senkawa, what are you doing here?

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:45.230
Staying at a friend's vacation home.

00:04:45.230 --> 00:04:47.220
A friend's vacation home?

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:50.100
What?!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.670
What the heck is Mr. Muroto doing here?!

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:54.740
I bumped into him on my walk.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:56.840
Hi, guys!

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.510
That didn't mean you had to <i>bring</i> him here.

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:02.450
Hayamiya! You don't want to help
a graduate of your school in trouble?

00:05:02.450 --> 00:05:05.080
Don't you have any school spirit?!

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:09.990
Sure I do! I'd be happy to help
Ms. Sanada in any way I could!

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:11.450
Who's that?

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:14.620
Hmm, I remember that he's an old boy...

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:19.800
The name's Muroto. Keisuke Muroto.
Of the 23rd graduating class.

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:21.260
Uh-huh...

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:23.830
Please don't pull that "old boy" act on us!

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:26.840
It'll put you out having this guy
suddenly foisted on you, right?

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:29.810
Hmm? Well, the more the merrier, right?

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:30.710
Huh?

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:34.340
Maybe it's my good character
that attracts such kind juniors.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:42.120
Ah, I'm in heaven!

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:47.560
You really love baths, huh?
You're always nagging me to switch with you.

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:51.660
It feels <i>way</i> nicer than that tune-up tank.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.730
What if someone sees you?

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:57.530
It'll be fine!
Everyone's totally into Mr. Muroto's stories.

00:05:57.530 --> 00:06:02.570
And this is the photo I took of the UFO!

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:05.170
UFOs really do exist!

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:06.540
Pretty awesome, huh?

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:11.080
- Awesome!
- Are those guys stupid?
Obviously all those UFO pics are fake.

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:13.050
So you don't believe in them.

00:06:13.050 --> 00:06:14.480
Of course not.

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:16.470
Say, Nakasugi, let's go for a walk.

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:22.560
Let's all go once Senkawa gets out of the bath.

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:23.990
Huh?

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.430
So in other words, I'm in the way, eh?

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:28.900
No, no, that's not true at all!

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:30.430
Sure, sure, don't worry about it.

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:31.930
Hayamiya...

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:34.930
I'll go get some fresh air by myself.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.840
Honestly...

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:41.370
I can see right through her.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:46.380
What a cool breeze... more like cold, actually.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:50.790
Aw, man! I made myself dizzy!

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:54.790
Hey!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:01.560
Gah! What the heck, Hayamiya?!
Don't look! Go away!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.230
S-S-Sorry!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:06.470
And no more peeking!

00:07:06.470 --> 00:07:10.910
That's so weird... Maybe I'm tired or something?

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:15.770
Carelessness is the greatest enemy...

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.780
Sayaka!

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:20.280
Grandfather!

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:22.050
You're all right, Sayaka?

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:25.550
Yes, we're all fine.

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:26.890
Sir!

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:29.160
Ah, Yoshie, so you're safe too.

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.890
Thank goodness, eh Mr. Chairman?

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:35.930
It's nice to meet you, Sayaka.
I'm Satyajit Shyamalan.

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.930
I owe your grandfather a great deal.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.440
Mr. Shyamalan?

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:42.340
It's Satyajit Shyamalan!

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:46.140
So Nakasugi's grandpa knows him? That's amazing!

00:07:46.140 --> 00:07:49.280
Now, don't treat me like some celebrity.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.850
The press is just soft-soaping me, that's all.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:55.680
But they'll be panning me
soon enough. Count on it.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:58.590
He's so famous, but he's not stuck up at all.

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:00.580
He's just a weirdo.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.760
I was on my way here for a bit of business

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:06.430
when I ran into your grandfather.

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:08.500
So, I asked him to bring me along.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:13.700
I see you're as beautiful as I'd heard.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.440
Pleased to meet you.

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:17.140
Come on inside.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:19.140
Thank you.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.770
Satyajit Shyamalan?

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:30.720
Come in!

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.960
Oh, Hayamiya. What's up?

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:38.160
You came to visit your hated senior?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:43.560
I'm suspicious about why my hated
senior suddenly showed up here.

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.970
You're here about what
happened in Sawajiri, aren't you?

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:50.840
Now that you mention it, that
landslide <i>was</i> near here, huh?

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.680
I think there's something strange going on.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:56.250
It seems like the news is covering something up...

00:08:56.250 --> 00:08:58.880
So you want to see it with your own eyes?

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.720
I want to tell everyone the truth!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:07.190
There's no guarantee that
anyone <i>wants</i> to know the truth.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:13.100
Human beings only believe in what
they want to see or want to know.

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:16.400
I don't think that's true at all!

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:21.540
Well, maybe you're right,

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:27.110
but <i>I want to know the truth,
and I want to tell everyone about it.</i>

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:32.450
Jeez... I wonder if I was ever like you?

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:33.680
Huh?

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:37.690
I'm sorting all the newspaper and
TV reports into chronological order.

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:39.890
Want to help?

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.520
Yes! I'll do it!

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:51.570
It's beautiful... An overwhelming beauty!

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:55.440
The god of destruction
has descended onto this land!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.640
This is the power of the Ryunka!

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:02.270
It came to Earth to select
the fittest of the human race!

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:07.380
This is the best feeling! The best!

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:18.430
Mr. Shyamalan, we need
you to wear a hazmat suit.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.930
If something should happen...

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:24.920
I'm one of the chosen ones.

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:35.580
A survivor?!

00:10:35.580 --> 00:10:41.120
Behold! This child was chosen
out of the Ryunka's destruction!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:44.110
He is the very proof of the Ryunka's power!

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:52.150
I'll raise this boy.

00:10:54.860 --> 00:10:57.170
Arrange for his adoption.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.370
Mr. Shyamalan?!

00:10:59.370 --> 00:11:02.040
Find a clue to the Ryunka as fast as you can.

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:05.030
I'll keep the press and the police quiet for a while.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:11.880
Ondine...

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.970
What is it, Birdy?

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:33.840
I got a little concerned.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.830
Wait, what are they doing?

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:42.210
They don't look like the police or rescue workers.

00:11:42.210 --> 00:11:43.200
Huh?

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:55.220
They must be investigating the Ryunka.

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:56.330
The Ryunka?

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:57.690
Yes.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.500
But we don't know if it
was the Ryunka or not, right?

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:02.490
And who would do this?

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:09.740
The invisible death, huh?

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:14.740
An abnormal incident on the planet
someone smuggled an abnormal weapon to.

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:17.710
We'd be crazy <i>not</i> to draw a connection.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:18.880
You've got a point...

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:21.580
We have to find out who has the Ryunka.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.020
Who's there?!

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:27.590
Found you!

00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:28.590
Huh?

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.420
Dammit!

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:32.760
Mr. Muroto!

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:47.380
Muroto, are you all right?

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:49.240
Muroto?

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.580
- Run.
- What?

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.620
Just run, fast!

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:55.950
Muroto!

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:56.820
There they are!

00:12:56.820 --> 00:12:57.620
Over there!

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:58.790
Get out of here, Hayamiya!

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.890
- But...
- Just get going!

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:05.430
Hey! Over here! Okay, go!

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.050
Don't let him go!

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.600
Did I get him?

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:14.000
I'm not sure. Let's go check.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:19.440
Why do those guys have guns? This is not funny!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:21.970
Muroto!

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.680
There she is!

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.680
Get rid of her.

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:35.660
What's with that thing?

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.090
Don't point your toy guns at me!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:53.640
What the?

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:54.880
An alien?!

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:59.870
Those weapons won't work on me.
But they do kind of hurt!

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:09.020
Quick, shoot her!

00:14:13.530 --> 00:14:17.400
I can't believe I took a high
school girl to such a hairy scene...

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:19.390
I'm a careless bastard!

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:24.740
Y-You're...

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:30.480
Take this girl and get out of here.
I'll draw them away from you.

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:32.350
Shion Arita...

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:35.150
Hey! It's that chick from the bath!

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:36.050
Where did they go?

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:38.720
Find them!

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:40.560
Maybe we're okay now.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:43.260
I think Hayamiya and Muroto probably got away.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:46.490
Yeah. In that case, we'll nab one of them and...

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:56.730
What was that?

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:04.600
Birdy Cephon, I won't let you interfere.

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:10.780
Who is this?!

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:23.030
Dammit!

00:15:23.030 --> 00:15:24.430
Take this!

00:15:34.710 --> 00:15:36.250
You're...

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:43.080
I am Ondine. I will kill you, Birdy Cephon.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:48.650
She's...

00:15:58.570 --> 00:15:59.840
Ow!

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:01.000
Who is that?!

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:01.900
I think she's...

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:03.440
You won't get away.

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.430
Here she comes!

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:14.150
Ow!

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:18.190
Are you okay, Birdy? She's crazy strong!

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:22.120
She's a genuine battle marionette.
That's not Earth technology.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:23.960
- You mean...
- She's coming!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:36.140
Even your lxioran biodefense
shield can't defend against this.

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:42.540
Die.

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:43.980
Birdy!

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:58.180
That's... enough!

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:20.420
Birdy, are you okay?

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:24.250
Ouch... She pulled out a bunch of my hair!

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:40.330
Birdy Cephon...

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:53.010
I see the quality of Federation
inspectors has really gone down.

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.250
Where's your Marker?

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.750
Marker?

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:59.590
Don't play dumb! You're that Altan!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:05.220
I have no idea what you mean.

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:12.130
That's my evidence!

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:23.950
What you need to do isn't to fight
marionettes, it's to find the Ryunka.

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.480
I knew you were...

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:32.820
It looks like you don't even
know what the Ryunka is.

00:18:32.820 --> 00:18:35.820
As your compatriot, I'll give you one <i>hint:</i>

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:39.660
The Ryunka possesses people.
It matures with people.

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:50.340
Shit... That hurts!

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.440
I won't let him go!

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:55.910
Give it up, Birdy. Your body's totally banged up!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:58.450
And he seems tough.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.850
Next time I see him, I'm gonna cream him!

00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:03.590
She took down Ondine?

00:19:03.590 --> 00:19:06.990
That bastard Gomez was
talking a big game about her...

00:19:06.990 --> 00:19:10.190
It wasn't her fault. Her opponent was too strong.

00:19:10.190 --> 00:19:15.600
Oh, is she your friend?
The "Federation investigator"?

00:19:15.600 --> 00:19:20.600
Birdy the Berserker Killer? She's no friend of mine.

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:24.540
You're my only friend.

00:19:24.540 --> 00:19:31.380
It's almost time. Before long,
I'll be giving you the Ryunka.

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:34.820
Someone like you might
be able to make full use of it.

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:40.620
You'd better believe I can.

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:00.240
What's she's doing here?

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:02.040
Birdy, switch with me.

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:03.010
Are you sure?

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:04.640
Hurry!

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:09.550
Ouch!

